 "content": {
  "title_ko": "K-뷰티 레이더 | 대미 수출 14% 증가, 관세 변수와 中 색조의 추격",
  "excerpt_ko": "미국향 K-뷰티 수출이 14% 늘고 무역수지 흑자가 17.0% 확대됐습니다. 한편 대미 흑자 1000억달러 접근에 따른 관세 부담, '가성비'를 벗은 중국 색조의 추격, 아마존 성과와 수출 상담 현장 소식을 정리했습니다.",
  "body_ko_html": "<h2>1. 미국향 K-뷰티 수출 14% 증가, 무역수지 17.0% 확대</h2><p><strong>무슨 일:</strong> 뷰티경제의 K-뷰티 3강 시장 분석에 따르면 미국 수출은 14% 늘었고, 화장품 무역수지는 17.0% 커졌습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9qSFVMeWlmbVZIZlNBd29Qbm9fbmh3V1VQTVhsSnpzZnFVOW5tbHRRV1RUTzZCTzEtUzJEa2tqVEM3Q3gyRnRTUVd6OHF2NERuRzdYdXJCeF9jYjNaTWgzd0RyUEluRFNKckE?oc=5'>뷰티경제</a>) 코스인코리아는 이달 셋째 주 주가 급락에도 수출 증가로 4분기 실적 개선 기대가 커지고 있다고 전했습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE8zQjVxTTRDbEJnYXZjeVBYT19qM2lub2tsRURHeVBTMWJtZmVCRi12bDVpX1BLcUJHQlR6aDBXaXpscEtyalVhWjFYRXJ1bEVUVGdWT3NvR2dHZncyY1Jsd0dWbw?oc=5'>코스인코리아닷컴</a>)</p><p><strong>왜 중요한가:</strong> 미국이 핵심 성장 시장이라는 점이 수치로 다시 확인됐습니다.</p><p><strong>실행 포인트:</strong> 4분기 연말 시즌 미국 채널 재고·광고 예산을 조기에 확정하세요.</p><h2>2. 대미 무역흑자 1000억달러 근접…관세 부담 우려</h2><p><strong>무슨 일:</strong> 한국의 대미 무역흑자가 1000억달러에 다가서면서 트럼프 행정부의 관세 압박이 커질 수 있다는 분석이 나왔습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9Ra1hOb2JyWmlUaHBaWWtSdFhPLVVfVVl5Y3p6QXVnaVVxdkNubUNfenJ3TEh0Xy1mWUJOaERoTFpEcDkxTmdQbUNKeFBicWE2ejYzWFdaZnViZ9IBWEFVX3lxTFBMT0ZmcjdxS3ZlWG43cV9rbUpvSXM5YUJocnFjb0FaVFBIdlJKRGtJOVhoZFNiT2RZMUJvTTFkVzVRSlVUUUNYbnFJWlltUkJ4TkgtZWY1ZGs?oc=5'>아주경제</a>)</p><p><strong>왜 중요한가:</strong> 화장품 대미 흑자 확대 자체가 통상 리스크의 일부가 될 수 있습니다.</p><p><strong>실행 포인트:</strong> 관세율 변동 시나리오별 아마존·리테일 판매가와 마진을 미리 시뮬레이션하세요.</p><h2>3. '가성비' 벗은 중국 화장품, K-뷰티 색조 공략</h2><p><strong>무슨 일:</strong> 중국 화장품이 저가 이미지에서 벗어나 K-뷰티의 색조 영역부터 파고들고 있다는 보도입니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9YYjhiRlBqTVR3dHJHWEI5UTZ0QWdZZTc0TE15a2pJdzFNZ1hzNUpaZGl0QTZJaEdsX01UZTU5NnFiOXVjUE9scFBDMURvQUpkdmIzM3hGY01xYjBMLVpHWVc4UGs5YUZsV2FvdHkyRGo?oc=5'>연합인포맥스</a>)</p><p><strong>왜 중요한가:</strong> 동남아·글로벌 플랫폼에서 K-색조의 가격·트렌드 우위가 좁혀질 수 있습니다.</p><p><strong>실행 포인트:</strong> 색조 브랜드는 쉐이드 정확도·피부톤 매칭 등 기능 차별점을 전면에 내세우세요. 에스쁘아가 피부톤 맞춤 베이스 솔루션을 해외 매체에 소개한 것도 같은 맥락입니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1ydWhZd3B6SjZiSUtFeVhiTWRmYktCX0txZV92YzVxZGdWZjh4UHJIa1VDU2tQTFdwQlRMR0IzZlo4UmM3RmFXdXpLSUItb1d0R2RqRWdSYw?oc=5'>Kagit</a>)</p><h2>4. 센텔리안24, 美 아마존서 최대 성과</h2><p><strong>무슨 일:</strong> 동국제약 계열 브랜드로 알려진 센텔리안24가 미국 아마존에서 역대 최대 성과를 냈고, AGE20'S는 서울에서 대규모 옥외광고를 펼쳤습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5JTGpJTXZUSk1xUkhvTllselRvSWliOFZlY25vNGlkTHZvVHo1bHpUM1l6YmdFRjNRVUN4ZnptR2tLSnBubWRETGl0VXdXNVVraVRza3VaTXdOM1dwUG1QVDJDNXp0dw?oc=5'>싱글리스트</a>) 뉴스핌은 제약사·의료기기 업체까지 가세한 '피부과학' 더마 경쟁을 짚었습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4yLVRMT09oQUM2Y0lWNkprSGNUZEpSMjk0RnJ5a0xvM3pzeUp0bzhwRGtwbE1vajYtaXJGRWo5U3ZEWjgwMTZrdUNYd25yVmJFYXB4UDFQQ3kzR1Nw?oc=5'>뉴스핌</a>)</p><p><strong>왜 중요한가:</strong> 아마존에서 더마·성분 스토리가 매출로 이어지는 흐름이 이어지고 있습니다.</p><p><strong>실행 포인트:</strong> 상세페이지에 임상·성분 근거를 정리하고, 경쟁 더마 SKU와의 차별점을 명확히 하세요.</p><h2>5. 뷰티엑스포, 사흘간 수출 상담 1200회</h2><p><strong>무슨 일:</strong> 국내외 화장품 기업이 모인 뷰티엑스포에서 사흘 동안 1200회의 수출 상담이 진행됐습니다. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9CaGhKaTJaOU1md3l4Nkk2OThIa0t6bVE5dnRGMU9Qa2thaUtZeHVtLVFJdDJsVXhVN1FZVmRGTThveG51VjRjVTBvdnduM0pxV0YyYWNR?oc=5'>중앙일보</a>)</p><p><strong>왜 중요한가:</strong> 중소 브랜드에게 해외 바이어와의 오프라인 접점은 여전히 유효한 채널입니다.</p><p><strong>실행 포인트:</strong> 박람회 상담 후 2주 내 샘플·견적·인증 서류를 묶은 후속 패키지를 발송하세요.</p><h2>출처</h2><ul><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9qSFVMeWlmbVZIZlNBd29Qbm9fbmh3V1VQTVhsSnpzZnFVOW5tbHRRV1RUTzZCTzEtUzJEa2tqVEM3Q3gyRnRTUVd6OHF2NERuRzdYdXJCeF9jYjNaTWgzd0RyUEluRFNKckE?oc=5'>뷰티경제 - K-뷰티 수출 3강 시장 분석①</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE8zQjVxTTRDbEJnYXZjeVBYT19qM2lub2tsRURHeVBTMWJtZmVCRi12bDVpX1BLcUJHQlR6aDBXaXpscEtyalVhWjFYRXJ1bEVUVGdWT3NvR2dHZncyY1Jsd0dWbw?oc=5'>코스인코리아닷컴 - 10월 3주 화장품 주가</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9Ra1hOb2JyWmlUaHBaWWtSdFhPLVVfVVl5Y3p6QXVnaVVxdkNubUNfenJ3TEh0Xy1mWUJOaERoTFpEcDkxTmdQbUNKeFBicWE2ejYzWFdaZnViZ9IBWEFVX3lxTFBMT0ZmcjdxS3ZlWG43cV9rbUpvSXM5YUJocnFjb0FaVFBIdlJKRGtJOVhoZFNiT2RZMUJvTTFkVzVRSlVUUUNYbnFJWlltUkJ4TkgtZWY1ZGs?oc=5'>아주경제 - 대미 무역흑자 1000억달러 눈앞</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9YYjhiRlBqTVR3dHJHWEI5UTZ0QWdZZTc0TE15a2pJdzFNZ1hzNUpaZGl0QTZJaEdsX01UZTU5NnFiOXVjUE9scFBDMURvQUpkdmIzM3hGY01xYjBMLVpHWVc4UGs5YUZsV2FvdHkyRGo?oc=5'>연합인포맥스 - 가성비 벗은 中 화장품</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1ydWhZd3B6SjZiSUtFeVhiTWRmYktCX0txZV92YzVxZGdWZjh4UHJIa1VDU2tQTFdwQlRMR0IzZlo4UmM3RmFXdXpLSUItb1d0R2RqRWdSYw?oc=5'>Kagit - Espoir 베이스 메이크업</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5JTGpJTXZUSk1xUkhvTllselRvSWliOFZlY25vNGlkTHZvVHo1bHpUM1l6YmdFRjNRVUN4ZnptR2tLSnBubWRETGl0VXdXNVVraVRza3VaTXdOM1dwUG1QVDJDNXp0dw?oc=5'>싱글리스트 - 센텔리안24 美 아마존 최대 성과</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4yLVRMT09oQUM2Y0lWNkprSGNUZEpSMjk0RnJ5a0xvM3pzeUp0bzhwRGtwbE1vajYtaXJGRWo5U3ZEWjgwMTZrdUNYd25yVmJFYXB4UDFQQ3kzR1Nw?oc=5'>뉴스핌 - K뷰티 호황⑥ 더마 경쟁</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9CaGhKaTJaOU1md3l4Nkk2OThIa0t6bVE5dnRGMU9Qa2thaUtZeHVtLVFJdDJsVXhVN1FZVmRGTThveG51VjRjVTBvdnduM0pxV0YyYWNR?oc=5'>중앙일보 - 뷰티엑스포 수출 상담 1200회</a></li></ul><p>이 브리프는 AI의 도움을 받아 작성되었습니다.</p>",
  "threads_ko": "미국향 K-뷰티 수출 +14%, 그런데 관세 청구서도 다가온다 👀\n\n• 대미 화장품 수출 14%↑, 무역수지 17.0% 확대\n• 대미 무역흑자 1000억달러 근접 → 관세 압박 우려\n• '가성비' 벗은 中 화장품, K-색조부터 추격\n\n4분기 미국 채널 마진 시뮬레이션, 지금 해두세요.\n\n#K뷰티 #화장품수출 #아마존",
  "title_en": "K-Beauty Radar | US Shipments Up 14% as Tariff Risk and Chinese Color Cosmetics Loom",
  "excerpt_en": "Korean cosmetics exports to the US grew 14% with the beauty trade surplus widening 17.0%. Buyers should weigh rising tariff pressure, a more premium Chinese makeup push, Amazon momentum in derma brands and fresh supplier pipelines from Beauty Expo.",
  "body_en_html": "<h2>1. Korean beauty exports to the US up 14%</h2><p><strong>What happened:</strong> A market analysis by Beauty Economy reports K-beauty exports to the US rose 14%, while Korea's cosmetics trade surplus expanded 17.0%. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9qSFVMeWlmbVZIZlNBd29Qbm9fbmh3V1VQTVhsSnpzZnFVOW5tbHRRV1RUTzZCTzEtUzJEa2tqVEM3Q3gyRnRTUVd6OHF2NERuRzdYdXJCeF9jYjNaTWgzd0RyUEluRFNKckE?oc=5'>Beauty Economy</a>) Despite a sharp sell-off in Korean beauty stocks this week, export growth is lifting expectations for Q4 results. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE8zQjVxTTRDbEJnYXZjeVBYT19qM2lub2tsRURHeVBTMWJtZmVCRi12bDVpX1BLcUJHQlR6aDBXaXpscEtyalVhWjFYRXJ1bEVUVGdWT3NvR2dHZncyY1Jsd0dWbw?oc=5'>CosinKorea</a>)</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> US demand for Korean products remains on a growth track heading into holiday season.</p><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> Lock in Q4 and early-2026 replenishment volumes with Korean suppliers now, before capacity tightens.</p><h2>2. Korea's US trade surplus nears $100B, raising tariff concerns</h2><p><strong>What happened:</strong> Korea's trade surplus with the US is approaching $100 billion, and Korean media flag a growing risk of tariff pressure from the Trump administration. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9Ra1hOb2JyWmlUaHBaWWtSdFhPLVVfVVl5Y3p6QXVnaVVxdkNubUNfenJ3TEh0Xy1mWUJOaERoTFpEcDkxTmdQbUNKeFBicWE2ejYzWFdaZnViZ9IBWEFVX3lxTFBMT0ZmcjdxS3ZlWG43cV9rbUpvSXM5YUJocnFjb0FaVFBIdlJKRGtJOVhoZFNiT2RZMUJvTTFkVzVRSlVUUUNYbnFJWlltUkJ4TkgtZWY1ZGs?oc=5'>Aju Business Daily</a>)</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Landed costs for K-beauty imports could shift quickly if trade terms change.</p><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> US importers should clarify Incoterms and tariff-sharing clauses in upcoming purchase agreements.</p><h2>3. Chinese brands move upmarket, targeting K-beauty makeup</h2><p><strong>What happened:</strong> Chinese cosmetics brands are shedding their budget positioning and pushing into color cosmetics, a category where K-beauty has been strong. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9YYjhiRlBqTVR3dHJHWEI5UTZ0QWdZZTc0TE15a2pJdzFNZ1hzNUpaZGl0QTZJaEdsX01UZTU5NnFiOXVjUE9scFBDMURvQUpkdmIzM3hGY01xYjBMLVpHWVc4UGs5YUZsV2FvdHkyRGo?oc=5'>Yonhap Infomax</a>) Korean makeup brand Espoir is meanwhile promoting skin-tone-matched base makeup to international audiences. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1ydWhZd3B6SjZiSUtFeVhiTWRmYktCX0txZV92YzVxZGdWZjh4UHJIa1VDU2tQTFdwQlRMR0IzZlo4UmM3RmFXdXpLSUItb1d0R2RqRWdSYw?oc=5'>Kagit</a>)</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Makeup buyers will face more competitive alternatives, especially on marketplaces like TikTok Shop and Shopee.</p><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> Benchmark K-makeup assortments against Chinese entrants on shade range and performance, not just price.</p><h2>4. Centellian24 posts record Amazon US result; derma race intensifies</h2><p><strong>What happened:</strong> Korean skincare brand Centellian24 achieved its best-ever performance on Amazon US, while AGE20'S ran a large outdoor campaign in Seoul. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5JTGpJTXZUSk1xUkhvTllselRvSWliOFZlY25vNGlkTHZvVHo1bHpUM1l6YmdFRjNRVUN4ZnptR2tLSnBubWRETGl0VXdXNVVraVRza3VaTXdOM1dwUG1QVDJDNXp0dw?oc=5'>Singlelist</a>) Korean pharma and medical-device firms are also joining the dermocosmetics race. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4yLVRMT09oQUM2Y0lWNkprSGNUZEpSMjk0RnJ5a0xvM3pzeUp0bzhwRGtwbE1vajYtaXJGRWo5U3ZEWjgwMTZrdUNYd25yVmJFYXB4UDFQQ3kzR1Nw?oc=5'>Newspim</a>)</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Science-backed Korean derma lines are converting on Amazon, and the supplier pool is widening.</p><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> When sourcing derma SKUs, request clinical data and ingredient documentation up front to support listings and claims.</p><h2>5. Beauty Expo logs 1,200 export meetings in three days</h2><p><strong>What happened:</strong> A Korean beauty expo bringing together domestic and overseas cosmetics companies recorded 1,200 export consultations over three days. (<a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9CaGhKaTJaOU1md3l4Nkk2OThIa0t6bVE5dnRGMU9Qa2thaUtZeHVtLVFJdDJsVXhVN1FZVmRGTThveG51VjRjVTBvdnduM0pxV0YyYWNR?oc=5'>JoongAng Ilbo</a>)</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Trade shows remain a practical route to discover emerging Korean brands before they hit major marketplaces.</p><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> Add Korean regional beauty expos to your 2026 sourcing calendar.</p><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9qSFVMeWlmbVZIZlNBd29Qbm9fbmh3V1VQTVhsSnpzZnFVOW5tbHRRV1RUTzZCTzEtUzJEa2tqVEM3Q3gyRnRTUVd6OHF2NERuRzdYdXJCeF9jYjNaTWgzd0RyUEluRFNKckE?oc=5'>Beauty Economy - K-beauty top-3 export markets (1)</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE8zQjVxTTRDbEJnYXZjeVBYT19qM2lub2tsRURHeVBTMWJtZmVCRi12bDVpX1BLcUJHQlR6aDBXaXpscEtyalVhWjFYRXJ1bEVUVGdWT3NvR2dHZncyY1Jsd0dWbw?oc=5'>CosinKorea - Cosmetics stocks, week 3 of October</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9Ra1hOb2JyWmlUaHBaWWtSdFhPLVVfVVl5Y3p6QXVnaVVxdkNubUNfenJ3TEh0Xy1mWUJOaERoTFpEcDkxTmdQbUNKeFBicWE2ejYzWFdaZnViZ9IBWEFVX3lxTFBMT0ZmcjdxS3ZlWG43cV9rbUpvSXM5YUJocnFjb0FaVFBIdlJKRGtJOVhoZFNiT2RZMUJvTTFkVzVRSlVUUUNYbnFJWlltUkJ4TkgtZWY1ZGs?oc=5'>Aju Business Daily - US trade surplus near $100B</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9YYjhiRlBqTVR3dHJHWEI5UTZ0QWdZZTc0TE15a2pJdzFNZ1hzNUpaZGl0QTZJaEdsX01UZTU5NnFiOXVjUE9scFBDMURvQUpkdmIzM3hGY01xYjBMLVpHWVc4UGs5YUZsV2FvdHkyRGo?oc=5'>Yonhap Infomax - Chinese cosmetics target K-beauty makeup</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1ydWhZd3B6SjZiSUtFeVhiTWRmYktCX0txZV92YzVxZGdWZjh4UHJIa1VDU2tQTFdwQlRMR0IzZlo4UmM3RmFXdXpLSUItb1d0R2RqRWdSYw?oc=5'>Kagit - Espoir base makeup solutions</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5JTGpJTXZUSk1xUkhvTllselRvSWliOFZlY25vNGlkTHZvVHo1bHpUM1l6YmdFRjNRVUN4ZnptR2tLSnBubWRETGl0VXdXNVVraVRza3VaTXdOM1dwUG1QVDJDNXp0dw?oc=5'>Singlelist - Centellian24 Amazon record</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4yLVRMT09oQUM2Y0lWNkprSGNUZEpSMjk0RnJ5a0xvM3pzeUp0bzhwRGtwbE1vajYtaXJGRWo5U3ZEWjgwMTZrdUNYd25yVmJFYXB4UDFQQ3kzR1Nw?oc=5'>Newspim - K-beauty boom (6): derma competition</a></li><li><a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9CaGhKaTJaOU1md3l4Nkk2OThIa0t6bVE5dnRGMU9Qa2thaUtZeHVtLVFJdDJsVXhVN1FZVmRGTThveG51VjRjVTBvdnduM0pxV0YyYWNR?oc=5'>JoongAng Ilbo - Beauty Expo 1,200 export meetings</a></li></ul><p>This brief was prepared with AI assistance.</p>",
  "linkedin_en": "K-beauty's US momentum is real, but so is the policy risk.\n\nToday's K-Beauty Radar highlights:\n\n- Korean cosmetics exports to the US grew 14%, and the beauty trade surplus widened 17.0%. Korean analysts expect export strength to support Q4 results despite a volatile week for beauty stocks.\n- Korea's overall trade surplus with the US is nearing $100B, which local media say could invite heavier tariff pressure.\n- Chinese brands are moving beyond value pricing and targeting makeup, a K-beauty stronghold.\n- Centellian24 posted its best-ever Amazon US result as pharma and medical-device players crowd into dermocosmetics.\n- A Korean beauty expo logged 1,200 export meetings in three days.\n\nFor buyers and distributors, the practical moves are clear: secure Q4 replenishment early, revisit tariff-sharing terms in supplier contracts, and benchmark K-makeup against new Chinese entrants on performance rather than price alone.\n\nHow are you adjusting your K-beauty sourcing terms ahead of possible US tariff changes?",
